  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/HornedKirin_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You devour the life-energy of a creature, using it to revitalize yourself.</p><p>Until the start of the ability user's next turn, whenever you kill a creature, you regain <strong>Stamina</strong> equal to half the victim's total <strong>Stamina</strong> (minimum <strong>1</strong>).</p><p>If you damage a swarm, you recover <strong>Stamina</strong> equal to the <strong>Damage</strong> dealt.</p>",
